    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect?</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228930/extras/8504ebe00fa2721e7a00aa9a04ca4329.avif?t=1745937679\" width=612 height=100 /></span><br><br><strong>&quot;Short NTR Stories&quot;</strong> is a <strong>collection of independent</strong>, bite-sized tales exploring the <strong>netorare (NTR)</strong> genre. As you finish a story it unlocks another one. Each story stands on its own, featuring different characters, scenarios, and relationships, all tied together by the common theme of <strong>NTR</strong>\u2014where a character's partner is taken by another, exploring <strong>emotional and physical</strong> challenges in various situations. With a game resolution of <strong>1920x1080</strong>, each scene is carefully crafted. The game also includes an <strong>in-game gallery</strong>, allowing you to revisit the stories as you explore this provocative and complex fetish.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Animated</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228930/extras/0b396ed2c69d7a0ad60cc7a6b61cc8ed.poster.avif?t=1745937679\" width=612 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228930/extras/0b396ed2c69d7a0ad60cc7a6b61cc8ed.webm?t=1745937679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228930/extras/0b396ed2c69d7a0ad60cc7a6b61cc8ed.mp4?t=1745937679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game features high-quality animations designed to bring each story to life. With smooth transitions and attention to detail, the animations make every moment more immersive and impactful.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stories</h2></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A strange tradition</h2><span cla